---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: emst.series
  size: 1
  alias: s
permalink: "{{ s.url }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Federal Series Profile: {{ s.code }} {{ s.title }}"
---
{% import "macros.njk" as m %}
<h1>Federal Series Profile: {{ s.code }} {{ s.title }}</h1>
{{ m.hrDisclaimer() }}
<h2>Series register entry</h2>
<dl class="emst-dl">
  <dt>Status</dt><dd>{% if s.realignment %}<strong>Realignment proposed, not final.</strong> OPM's proposal would move this series{% if s.raw.successorSeries %} to {{ s.raw.successorSeries }}{% endif %}; as of {{ emst.release.date }} the series is still {{ s.code }}. This profile keeps the work and will re-point the series code only when OPM finalizes the change.{% else %}{{ s.seriesStatus | titlecase }}{% endif %}</dd>
  <dt>Occupational group</dt><dd>{{ s.group | replace("Occupational group: ", "") }}</dd>
  <dt>Qualification standard</dt><dd>{{ s.qualStd or "not recorded" }}{% if "verify" in s.qualStd %} <span class="emst-muted">(the register marks this for verification)</span>{% endif %}</dd>
  {% if s.raw.positiveEducationRequirement != null %}<dt>Positive education requirement</dt><dd>{{ "yes" if s.raw.positiveEducationRequirement else "no" }} <span class="emst-muted">(advisor judgment pending verification against the qualification standard)</span></dd>{% endif %}
  <dt>Review by</dt><dd>{{ s.reviewBy }}</dd>
</dl>
{{ m.meta(s.tier, s.evidence) }}

<h2>Role variants crosswalked to this series</h2>
{% if s.roleRows.length %}
<div class="emst-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Role crosswalk">
<table class="usa-table usa-table--compact" data-figure data-use-tier="exploratory" data-evidence="S">
  <caption>Draft role-to-series crosswalk (X4). <span class="emst-badge emst-badge--tier" data-badge="tier"><span class="emst-badge__k">Use tier:</span>exploratory</span> <span class="emst-badge emst-badge--ev" data-badge="evidence"><span class="emst-badge__k">Evidence:</span>agent-drafted mapping, {{ (s.roleRows | first).reviewStatus }}</span></caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">EMST role</th><th scope="col">Match</th><th scope="col">Applies to</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for r in s.roleRows %}
  <tr><td>{% if r.variant %}<a href="{{ r.variant.url | url }}">{{ r.subjectLabel }}</a>{% elif r.role %}<a href="{{ r.role.url | url }}">{{ r.subjectLabel }}</a>{% else %}{{ r.subjectLabel }} <span class="emst-muted">(role profile not yet in this build)</span>{% endif %}</td>
  <td>{{ r.predicate | replace("skos:", "") }}, confidence {{ r.confidence }}</td><td>{{ r.other.applies_to or "all levels" }}</td><td>{{ r.comment | truncate(200) }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="emst-muted">A crosswalk row says the role's work is found in positions of this series. It is not a classification determination and claims no alignment with OPM standards.</p>
{% else %}<p>No EMST role is crosswalked to this series in this build.</p>{% endif %}

<h2>Major duties and competencies by federal variant</h2>
{% if s.profile and s.profile.roles.length %}
<p class="emst-muted">Generated by <code>{{ s.profile.stamp.generator }}</code> (rule {{ s.profile.stamp.ruleId }}@{{ s.profile.stamp.ruleVersion }}, {{ s.profile.stamp.ruleStatus }}), as of {{ s.profile.stamp.asOf }}, and re-checked against release {{ emst.release.id }}.</p>
<div class="emst-callout" role="note"><p><strong>% time: set by the supervisor; EMST supplies none before job analysis.</strong> Importance, time share, critical and needed-at-entry values are job-analysis values and are not shown until a job analysis confirms them. Duty lists and target levels are editorial drafts (agent-drafted, unreviewed). Credential gates appear only when the credential's issuer has been verified; others are counted, not shown.</p></div>
{% for r in s.profile.roles %}
<section class="emst-card" aria-labelledby="fr-{{ loop.index }}">
  <h3 id="fr-{{ loop.index }}">{% if r.variant %}<a href="{{ r.variant.url | url }}">{{ r.role.title }} (federal)</a>{% else %}{{ r.role.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
  <p>{{ r.functionStatement }}</p>
  <p>Crosswalk to this series: {{ r.x4.predicate | replace("skos:", "") }}, confidence {{ r.x4.confidence }}{% if r.x4.appliesTo %}, applies to {{ r.x4.appliesTo }}{% endif %} ({{ r.x4.reviewStatus }}, agent draft). Profile depth: {{ r.depth }}.</p>
  {% if r.credentialGates.shown.length %}<p>Credentials that may be involved (agent-drafted link, not a verified requirement; credential issuer verified): {% for g in r.credentialGates.shown %}{{ g.title }} (drafted as {{ g.kind }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% endif %}
  {% if r.credentialGates.pending %}<p class="emst-muted">{{ r.credentialGates.pending }} further credential link{{ "s" if r.credentialGates.pending != 1 }} not shown until verified against a source.</p>{% endif %}
  {% if r.instruments.length %}<p>Policy instruments that shape this work (status as of {{ emst.release.date }}): {% for i in r.instruments %}{{ i.title }} ({{ m.instrumentState(i) }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% endif %}
  {% for b in r.bands %}
  <h4>{{ b.group | sentence }}{% if b.band %}: indicative {{ b.band }}{% endif %} <span class="emst-muted">(agent-drafted band; not a classification criterion)</span></h4>
  {% set dflt = b.duties | where("isDefault", true) %}{% set other = b.duties | where("isDefault", false) %}
  <div class="emst-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Major duties, {{ b.group }}">
  <table class="usa-table usa-table--compact" data-figure data-use-tier="{{ r.variant.tier.tier if r.variant else 'exploratory' }}" data-evidence="S">
    <caption>Major duties, {{ b.group }} ({{ b.roleLevels | join(", ") }}); editorial draft. {{ m.tierBadge(r.variant.tier if r.variant else {"tier": "exploratory", "source": "no variant"}) }} <span class="emst-badge emst-badge--ev" data-badge="evidence"><span class="emst-badge__k">Evidence:</span>S speculation; agent-drafted duty list, unreviewed</span></caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Major duty</th><th scope="col">% time</th><th scope="col">Tasks</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for d in dflt %}
    <tr><td><a href="{{ d.competency.url | url }}">{{ d.duty }}</a>{% if d.competency.isModule %} <span class="emst-muted">({{ d.competency.moduleLabel }}: editorial section, not a stewarded module)</span>{% endif %}</td><td>{% if d.pctTime != null %}{{ d.pctTime }}%{% else %}<span class="emst-pending">set by the supervisor</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td><ul class="usa-list usa-list--unstyled">{% for t in d.tasks %}<li>{{ t.task.statement }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></td></tr>
    {% else %}<tr><td colspan="3">No established duty from the core or this role's home module in this band.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% if other.length %}
  <details class="emst-disclosure"><summary>{{ other.length }} more dut{{ "ies" if other.length != 1 else "y" }} from other module editorial sections or not yet established (not part of the default HR view)</summary>
  <div><ul class="usa-list">{% for d in other %}<li><a href="{{ d.competency.url | url }}">{{ d.duty }}</a> ({{ d.competency.moduleLabel if d.competency.isModule else d.competency.lifecycleState }})</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></details>
  {% endif %}
  {% set k1 = b.factor1 | where("isDefault", true) %}
  {% if k1.length %}
  <p><strong>Factor 1 (knowledge required), established core and home-module content (editorial draft):</strong></p>
  <ul class="usa-list">{% for k in k1 %}<li>{{ k.statement }}{% for x in k.knowledge %}<br><span class="emst-muted">{{ x }}</span>{% endfor %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endfor %}
{% if s.profile.withoutFed.length %}<p>Roles mapped to this series with no federal variant in the role set: {% for r in s.profile.withoutFed %}<a href="{{ r.url | url }}">{{ r.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% endif %}
{% if s.profile.feeders.length %}<p>Feeder or destination roles: {% for r in s.profile.feeders %}<a href="{{ r.url | url }}">{{ r.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% endif %}
<p class="emst-muted">General competencies (USA Hire, OPM general competency models): {{ s.profile.generalCompetencies }}.</p>
{% elif s.fedVariants.length %}
{% for v in s.fedVariants %}
<section class="emst-card" aria-labelledby="fv-{{ loop.index }}">
  <h3 id="fv-{{ loop.index }}"><a href="{{ v.url | url }}">{{ v.role.title }} (federal)</a></h3>
  {{ m.meta(v.tier, v.evidence) }}
  <p>Established core competencies: {% for t in v.hrTargets %}<a href="{{ t.competency.url | url }}">{{ t.competency.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% else %}none yet{% endfor %}.</p>
</section>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<div class="emst-callout emst-callout--empty" role="status">
  <p><strong>No federal role variant is crosswalked to this series in this build.</strong> The duties, % time, needed-at-entry flags and competency targets fill in when the role-profile work package adds a federal variant mapped to this series.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Competencies the federal HR advisor associated with this series</h2>
{% if s.coreComps.length %}
<p>Navigation aid carried from the federal advisor's Phase 2 judgment and re-pointed to v2 records (draft mapping, not reviewed). Established core competencies only.</p>
<ul class="usa-list">{% for r in s.coreComps %}<li><a href="{{ r.competency.url | url }}">{{ r.competency.title }}</a> <span class="emst-muted">({{ r.other.fh_relationship or r.predicate | replace("skos:", "") }}; {{ r.reviewStatus }})</span>{% if r.competency.federal %} · federal applicability: {{ r.competency.federal.value | replace("-", " ") }}{% if not r.competency.federal.basisLinked %} (basis not yet linked){% endif %}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% else %}<p>No established core competency is associated with this series in this build.</p>{% endif %}
{% if s.omittedModule or s.omittedNotEstablished %}<p class="emst-muted">Left out of this HR view: {{ s.omittedModule }} module editorial records and {{ s.omittedNotEstablished }} competencies that are not yet established.</p>{% endif %}
<p class="emst-muted">Federal applicability is read from the computed view ({{ "prototype computation, CR-SC-001 pending" if emst.venue.source == "wp05-prototype" else emst.venue.source }}) and shown with no exclusions (project lead default, Q4).</p>
